    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to bring to the market this substantial three-bedroom semi-detached family home, ideally situated in a mature and established residential setting in Santry. Extending over three floors, this impressive property has been thoughtfully extended to provide generous and versatile accommodation, with a side extension, extended kitchen and dedicated home office.\r\n\r\nOne of the property's most notable features is its large, private south-facing rear garden, which enjoys excellent natural light and incorporates a unique private spa area with sauna and hot tub, together with a beautiful octagonal sunroom. The property also benefits from ample off-street parking to the front.\r\n\r\nOn entering the property, the welcoming hallway leads to a generous front-to-back living room with feature stone fireplace and stove. The central dining area flows through to the impressive extended kitchen, which features extensive oak cabinetry, tiled flooring, skylight and ample space. \r\nThe ground floor also provides a home office, useful laundry room and shower room, making the accommodation particularly practical for modern family living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including an impressive primary bedroom overlooking the rear garden, a further double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and a single bedroom. A generous walk-in closet provides excellent additional storage, while the modern family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe attic level provides a large and versatile room, complete with skylight and eaves storage. This space offers excellent flexibility and could be utilised as an additional bedroom, home office or a studio."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Foyer - 1.93m (6'4\") x 3.87m (12'8\")\r\nWelcoming front entrance with timber wall panelling and carpeted stairs.\r\n\r\nOffice - 3.56m (11'8\") x 3.15m (10'4\")\r\nFront-facing workspace with extensive built-in cabinetry, desk area and wood-effect flooring, ideal as home office or study.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner - 2.93m (9'7\") x 6.42m (21'1\")\r\nGenerous galley-style kitchen with modern fitted units, tiled floor, skylight, and space for dining table; appliances include oven, hob, fridge freezer, dishwasher and washing machine.\r\n\r\nSauna - 1.51m (4'11\") x 1.86m (6'1\")\r\nTimber-clad sauna room with built-in bench seating, adjoining the spa-style bath area, perfect for relaxation.\r\n\r\nSpa Room (Rear Ground) - 2.8m (9'2\") x 4.42m (14'6\")\r\nSpacious room with Sauna and Jacuzzi.\r\n\r\nBath (Central Ground) - 2.29m (7'6\") x 1.84m (6'0\")\r\nFully tiled shower room with WC, wash-hand basin and plounge pool.\r\n\r\nHall (Inner Ground) - 2.29m (7'6\") x 1.63m (5'4\")\r\nInner corridor linking the foyer to the main reception and ground floor shower room, with timber panelling and red carpet.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.75m (12'4\") x 7.55m (24'9\")\r\nExpansive dual-aspect living room with feature stone fireplace and an elegant wood burning stove, ceiling coving with access to the sunroom.\r\n\r\nSun Room - 2.87m (9'5\") x 7.72m (25'4\")\r\nLarge octagonal sun room / conservatory overlooking the long rear garden, flooded with natural light.\r\n\r\nHall (First Floor) - 2.01m (6'7\") x 2.48m (8'2\")\r\nBright landing with timber wall panelling and window to the side, giving access to bedrooms, bathroom and stairs to the attic room.\r\n\r\nBath (First Floor) - 2.07m (6'9\") x 1.78m (5'10\")\r\nMain family bathroom with tiled walls and floor, shower enclosure, WC and pedestal wash-hand basin, finished in neutral tones.\r\n\r\nBedroom - 3.64m (11'11\") x 3.31m (10'10\")\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes, large window and carpeted flooring, overlooking the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nBedroom - 2.52m (8'3\") x 3.02m (9'11\")\r\nSingle bedroom  with built-in storage, carpeted floor.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom - 3.64m (11'11\") x 4.08m (13'5\")\r\nSpacious principal bedroom with extensive fitted wardrobes, large window and neutral décor.\r\n\r\nAttic Room - 5.05m (16'7\") x 2.88m (9'5\")\r\nVersatile attic space reached by fixed staircase, offering a generous additional room with rooflight, ideal as playroom, hobby room or storage.\r\n\r\nTotal Floor area: 179.95 m² / 1937 ft² approx.\r\n\r\nExternally: The front of the property features a spacious gated driveway. This area provides ample room for secure off-road parking. To the rear, there is a large south facing rear garden that offers significant outdoor space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Chain free sale\r\nSouth facing garden\r\nApprox 179 Sqm\r\nExtension to the rear\r\nAttic conversion\r\nSide extension\r\nSauna and hot tub room\r\nSunroom\r\nLarge rear garden\r\nAmple parking\r\nExcellent location"
      },
